# Raw cached SEC filings are regenerable via the pipeline (see README.md) and
# large (~121MB), so not committed. holdings_long.parquet IS committed despite
# being regenerable too: the deployed Streamlit Cloud app has nowhere to run
# the fetch pipeline at startup, so it needs this file present in the repo to
# have any data at all. Re-run the pipeline and commit the refreshed file to
# update it -- see README.md "Refreshing for a new quarter."
data/raw/
